    "since most of our remainding variables has outliers, our best option for scaling is a ```RobustScaler()``` since it uses IQ ranges to scale each value with the following formula:\n",
    "$$\n",
    "X_\\text{scaled} = \\frac{x_i - Q_1(x)}{Q_3 - Q_1}\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
